      "problem": "Find the minor of  ${e}_{14}$ in  $E=[\\begin{aligned}3 & \\sqrt{5} & 5 & 8 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & 2 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}].$",
